{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>These are the families of Naftali.</b> The total of all of them, aside from the tribe of Levi, is fifty-seven families. How so? In the camp of Yehudah: four for Reuven, five for Shimon, seven for Gad. Camp of the east: five for Yehudah, four for Yissakhar, three for Zevulun. Camp of the west: eight for Menasheh, four for Efrayim, seven for Binyamin. Camp of the north: one for Dan, five for Asher, four for Naftali."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:51.659718802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}